#: ../../source/m5ui/canvas.rst:8
msgid ""
"M5Canvas is a powerful graphics widget that provides a drawable surface "
"for creating custom graphics, animations, and visual effects in the user "
"interface. It supports drawing operations, sprite management, and "
"advanced graphics rendering."
msgstr "M5Canvas是一个强大的图形控件，提供可绘制的表面，用于在用户界面中创建自定义图形、动画和视觉效果。它支持绘图操作、图像管理和高级图形渲染。"

